{"styles":[{"sc":"#ff2600","so":1,"w":2,"ol":true,"fc":"#fffb00","fo":0.502}],"cards":["<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#222222;max-width:238px;\"><div style=\"background:#0e7d46;height:6px;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#0e7d46;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;padding:7px 0 0;\">COUNTY BOUNDARY</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#0e7d46;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;padding:0 0 2px;\">ARIZONA</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 0 6px;\">Yuma County</div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;\"><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Population</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">224,000 (2025 est.)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">County Seat</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">Yuma</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Land Area</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">5,514 sq mi</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Density</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">41 / sq mi</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Median Household Income</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">$62,900</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#666666;padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap;\">Median Home Value</td><td style=\"color:#111111;font-weight:600;\">$217,800</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#333333;padding:8px 0 2px;border-top:1px solid #eef2f1;margin-top:7px;\">Yuma County anchors Arizona's southwestern corner along the Colorado River and the Mexican border, with about 224,000 year-round residents concentrated in Yuma, San Luis and Somerton. Its economy is led by irrigated winter-vegetable agriculture — the county supplies a large share of North America's leafy greens between November and March — together with the Marine Corps Air Station Yuma and the Army's Yuma Proving Ground. The housing market is shaped by a substantial seasonal population that winters in the Foothills and surrounding RV and manufactured-home communities, and by cross-border commerce at the San Luis port of entry. Median home values remain the lowest of Arizona's larger counties.</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#888888;padding-top:6px;\">Source: U.S. Census Bureau · Data verified: August 30, 2026</div></div>"],"feats":[["Yuma",0,[[32.56334,-114.81406],[32.56525,-114.81401],[32.56616,-114.81382],[32.56802,-114.81332],[32.5685,-114.81312],[32.56885,-114.81292],[32.56912,-114.81265],[32.57011,-114.81069],[32.57053,-114.80987],[32.57098,-114.80866],[32.57115,-114.80829],[32.57206,-114.80656],[32.57317,-114.80416],[32.57352,-114.80357],[32.57379,-114.80321],[32.57406,-114.80292],[32.57461,-114.80252],[32.57641,-114.80155],[32.57737,-114.80115],[32.57797,-114.80108],[32.57851,-114.80119],[32.57894,-114.80136],[32.57925,-114.8016],[32.57969,-114.80205],[32.58097,-114.80346],[32.58123,-114.80367],[32.58177,-114.80392],[32.58199,-114.80395],[32.58224,-114.80392],[32.58324,-114.80365],[32.58411,-114.80317],[32.58534,-114.80243],[32.5861,-114.8018],[32.58716,-114.80101],[32.58783,-114.80046],[32.58838,-114.80018],[32.58896,-114.80001],[32.59047,-114.79991],[32.59119,-114.79977],[32.59262,-114.7994],[32.59312,-114.79939],[32.59408,-114.79949],[32.5949,-114.79982],[32.595,-114.79991],[32.59532,-114.80049],[32.59548,-114.80064],[32.5961,-114.80093],[32.59647,-114.80106],[32.59825,-114.80132],[32.59866,-114.80141],[32.59912,-114.80158],[32.59936,-114.80175],[32.59973,-114.80262],[32.60009,-114.80379],[32.60027,-114.80454],[32.60049,-114.80514],[32.6011,-114.80643],[32.60133,-114.80667],[32.60191,-114.80692],[32.6023,-114.80713],[32.60322,-114.80783],[32.6035,-114.80791],[32.60371,-114.80793],[32